<title>UK: UK's JBA offers 3.27 mln shares at 800p.</title>
<headline>UK's JBA offers 3.27 mln shares at 800p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British software and applications firm JBA Holdings Plc said on Friday it would be offering 3.27 million ordinary shares at 800p each.</p>
<p>The offer comprises 1.67 million of new ordinary shares and 1.60 million ordinary shares being sold off by existing shareholders, including some of the company's directors.</p>
<p>JBA said the offer would raise around 12.4 million stg, net of expenses. Dealing in the new shares was expected to begin at around 13.30 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
